---
description: Declare constants in a separate file and only re-export them from index.ts
alwaysApply: true
---

# Constants outside index.ts

Declare a constant in its own file. Re-export it from `index.ts`.

```ts
// catalog/constants.ts
export const PRODUCT_CATEGORIES: Record<CategoryId, Category> = {
  books: booksCategory,
}
```

```ts
// catalog/index.ts
export { PRODUCT_CATEGORIES } from './constants'
```

```ts
// ❌ declaring the constant in index.ts
export const PRODUCT_CATEGORIES = {
  books: booksCategory,
}
```
